  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Kbd",
    "Description",
    "Keyboard key label for documenting shortcuts. Pair in chords with a separator.",
    "Variants",
    "default      Inline use in menus, tooltips, and help content.\ntop-search   Muted style for keyboard hints inside the global search bar.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "One key per Kbd. Combine with + for chords: Ctrl + K.\nUse platform-correct modifier symbols: ⌘ Cmd on macOS, Ctrl elsewhere.\nUppercase letter keys; use symbols for arrows, Enter, Escape.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   One key per Kbd\nDO   Use + or → as the chord separator\nDO   Match platform modifier conventions\nDO   Uppercase letter keys",
    "DON'T   Stack multiple keys inside one Kbd\nDON'T   Use emoji for keys\nDON'T   Hardcode platform modifiers when both are shown\nDON'T   Use Kbd for mouse or gesture input"
  ],
